      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 26
      },
      "id": 30,
      "options": {
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": {
          "countRows": false,
          "reducer": [
            "sum"
          ],
          "show": false
        },
        "showHeader": true,
        "sortBy": [
          {
            "displayName": "Query",
            "desc": false
          }
        ]
      },
      "title": "Stage Metrics",
      "type": "table",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${metrics}"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(max_over_time({__name__=~\"flare_stage_executor_run_time(_milliseconds)?_bucket\", job=~\"$service\"}[$__range])) by (le, stage_name, sql_description, instance))",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "Executor Run Time p95",
          "format": "table"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${metrics}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(max_over_time({__name__=~\"flare_stage_input_bytes(_total)?\", job=~\"$service\"}[$__range])) by (stage_name, sql_description, instance)",
          "refId": "B",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "Input",
          "format": "table"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${metrics}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(max_over_time({__name__=~\"flare_stage_shuffle_read_bytes(_total)?\", job=~\"$service\"}[$__range])) by (stage_name, sql_description, instance)",
          "refId": "C",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "Shuffle Read",
          "format": "table"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${metrics}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(max_over_time({__name__=~\"flare_stage_shuffle_write_bytes(_total)?\", job=~\"$service\"}[$__range])) by (stage_name, sql_description, instance)",
          "refId": "D",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "Shuffle Write",
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "merge",
          "options": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "instance": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "Value #A": "Executor Run Time p95",
              "Value #B": "Input",
              "Value #C": "Shuffle Read",
              "Value #D": "Shuffle Write",
              "sql_description": "Query",
              "stage_name": "Stage Name (Spark)"
            },
            "indexByName": {
              "sql_description": 0,
              "stage_name": 1,
              "Value #A": 2,
              "Value #B": 3,
              "Value #C": 4,
              "Value #D": 5
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "description": "One row per call site and application: stages are grouped by what ran them, not by stage id, which is new for every stage and restarts per application (#136). instance (the per-JVM UUID) keeps applications apart. The Query column is sql.description; Stage Name is Spark’s own value, which for async subquery and broadcast stages reads $anonfun$withThreadLocalCaptured$2. A single stage is on its span in Tempo. Totals are since each application started, not only within the time range, so select a range that covers the application."
    },
